flowchart TD
    A[Caller passes bytes or text] --> B{Value serializes?}
    B -- no --> C[Raise before touching the filesystem]
    B -- yes --> D[Create an exclusive temporary file in the destination directory]
    D --> E[Set the final file mode]
    E --> F[Write, flush]
    F --> G{Durability}
    G -- none --> H{Publish how}
    G -- file or file+directory --> I[fsync the temporary file]
    I --> H
    H -- overwrite --> J[os.replace onto the destination]
    H -- create-only --> K[os.link; FileExistsError if it exists]
    J --> L{Durability is file+directory}
    K --> L
    L -- yes --> M[fsync the directory]
    L -- no --> N[Return the byte count]
    M --> N
    B -- exception --> O[Remove the temporary file; destination keeps its bytes]
    F -- exception --> O
